# WS2-02/WS2-03. # Sources: spec/03-ownership.md §3 (moves; a moved value is never dropped), §5 (drop order: locals in reverse declaration order, struct fields in declaration order, array elements first to last, parameters after the body locals; drops on every return/break/continue; exactly once), spec/04-expressions.md §3 (temporaries drop at statement end in reverse creation order).
 The per-iteration local drops at continue, break, and the
# normal end of each iteration.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: if (i == 4) ==> if (i == 3)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
use 10
drop 10
drop 11
use 12
drop 12
drop 13
end
--- contrast-output
use 10
drop 10
drop 11
drop 12
end
